  "notes": [
    "Registers are 0-based. Bit numbers: 0 = LSB, 15 = MSB. 32-bit values are assumed low word first (CDAB), as on the Unipi extensions; the manual does not state the word order.",
    "Registers marked Reserved in the manual are left out.",
    "Transport is not stated in the manual; Modbus TCP on port 502 is assumed.",
    "I/O, configuration and command registers are on Unit ID 1. The user LED, storage and connection registers (addresses 3000-4203) are on Unit ID 0. Defaults: debounce 50 (5 ms), DirectSwitch off, MWD timeout 2500 ms and disabled."
  ],
